  "description": "Erection of a detached, single-storey outbuilding in the rear garden at 39 Spring Road, Feltham, TW13 7JA, measuring 6.67m wide by 7.00m deep, with a flat GRP roof and a maximum overall height of 3.00m. The building will provide a private gym/storage room, home office and WC for use incidental to the existing dwelling. External walls will be brick-faced, with doors and windows facing into the garden. No separate residential accommodation or change of use is proposed.",
